{
  "id": "belts___pulley_diameters_vs__speed",
  "title": "Belts - Pulley Diameters vs. Speed",
  "description": "Calculate pulley speeds and diameters for single and multiple belt transmission systems using pulley diameter and speed relationships.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Pulley",
        "Diameter (mm)",
        "Speed (rpm)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "1",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "2",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "3",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "4",
          "",
          ""
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Single Belt Transmission Calculator\n\nFor a system with two pulleys (1 and 2):\n\n**Formula:** d₁ × n₁ = d₂ × n₂"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Single Belt Transmission"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "d1_single",
          "label": "Driving Pulley Diameter (mm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "n1_single",
          "label": "Driving Pulley Speed (rpm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "d2_single",
          "label": "Driven Pulley Diameter (mm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 50
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "n2_single",
          "label": "Driven Pulley Speed (rpm)",
          "formula": "(inputs.d1_single * inputs.n1_single) / inputs.d2_single",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Multiple Belt Transmission Calculator\n\nFor a system with four pulleys (1, 2, 3, 4):\n\n**Formula:** n₄ = n₁ × (d₁ × d₃) / (d₂ × d₄)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Multiple Belt Transmission"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "n1_multi",
          "label": "Pulley 1 Speed (rpm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "d1_multi",
          "label": "Pulley 1 Diameter (mm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "d2_multi",
          "label": "Pulley 2 Diameter (mm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 50
        },
        {
          "id": "d3_multi",
          "label": "Pulley 3 Diameter (mm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 110
        },
        {
          "id": "d4_multi",
          "label": "Pulley 4 Diameter (mm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 60
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "n2_multi",
          "label": "Pulley 2 Speed (rpm)",
          "formula": "inputs.n1_multi",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "n3_multi",
          "label": "Pulley 3 Speed (rpm)",
          "formula": "inputs.n1_multi",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "n4_multi",
          "label": "Pulley 4 Speed (rpm)",
          "formula": "inputs.n1_multi * (inputs.d1_multi * inputs.d3_multi) / (inputs.d2_multi * inputs.d4_multi)",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}